            <div xml:lang="gez" type="edition" xml:id="div2LIT7254PPMagic">
                <note>The following incipit and explicit are taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/UppEt46">Uppsala, Uppsala University Library, O Etiop. 46</ref>.</note>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit">
                    <ab>
                        በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩አምላክ፡
                        ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ ሕማመ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ዓይነ<supplied reason="omitted" resp="MV">ት</supplied>፡ ወጋርር፡ 
                        ወትግሪዳ፡ አድኅና፡ ለአመትከ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/>                        
                        ይትነሣእ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ወይዘረው<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied>
                        ጾሩ፡ ወይጕየዩ፡ ጸላእቱ።
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="explicit">
                    <ab>
                        ከመ፡ ኢይምጽኡ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ኀቤየ፡ ወከመ፡ ኢይቅረቡኒ፡ 
                        ኀቤየ፡ ወመንገሌየ፡ ወኢይበውኡ፡ ውስተ፡ ጽላሎተ፡ ቤትየ፡ ወከመ፡ ኢይቅረቡ፡ ኀበ፡ ነፍስየ፡ 
                        ወሥጋየ፡ ወአነኒ፡ ለአመትከ፡ 
                        <gap reason="ellipsis"/>
                    </ab>
                </div>
            </div>
